    "title": "如何安装打印控件",
    "keywords": "",
    "description": "",
    "content": "<p><strong>打印单据前，需要先安装智慧记AI进销存打印服务，下面来看看是怎么操作的吧</strong></p>\n<p><video src=\"https://ks3-cn-beijing.ksyun.com/zhjwebsite/uploads/202503/5a1de801564147b7dd0efea1d7cbfdfd.mp4\" controls=\"controls\" class=\"my-video\" style=\"max-width:100%\">\n\n\n视频描述\n</video></p>\n<p>安装Web打印服务</p>\n<p><strong>路径</strong>：【设置】-【基础设置】-【打印设置】-【打印模板】-【模板】-点击进入模板-【编辑打印模板】</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://ks3-cn-beijing.ksyun.com/zhjwebsite/uploads/202105/91a3e269a391a739eaca79e94f34fb80.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><strong>功能说明</strong>：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>\n<p>需先安装Web打印服务（CLodop_Setup_for_Win32NT.exe ），才可以启动打印。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>打印服务安装成功后，请刷新打印模板编辑页面。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://ks3-cn-beijing.ksyun.com/zhjwebsite/uploads/202105/9c80f2674f9ad8b4eb6624adfc996606.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n",
